; name: Shop fixtures
; group: Shop & machine
; description: Three fixtures from one 18 mm board: a tool rack for a French cleat (rip the cleat at 45° on the saw), four cam clamps for the spoilboard, and a drilling jig for 35 mm concealed hinges (its fence edge on the X axis; the screw positions drilled to mark through). Switch off the operations you don’t need.
; 
